su text "n:06332925-n | descriptive adjective | an adjective that ascribes to its noun the value of an attribute of that noun (e.g., ‘a nervous person’ or ‘a musical speaking voice’)" ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:06332925-n\",\"target\":\"descriptive adjective\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"descriptive adjective\",\"qualifying adjective\"],\"definition\":\"an adjective that ascribes to its noun the value of an attribute of that noun (e.g., ‘a nervous person’ or ‘a musical speaking voice’)\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"drut\",\"hcit\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-594e6b8b2b690786f5d7a3f3\"}" ya
su text "n:06334815-n | dangling modifier | a word or phrase apparently modifying an unintended word because of its placement in a sentence: e.g., ‘when young’ in ‘when young, circuses appeal to all of us’" ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:06334815-n\",\"target\":\"dangling modifier\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"dangling modifier\",\"misplaced modifier\"],\"definition\":\"a word or phrase apparently modifying an unintended word because of its placement in a sentence: e.g., ‘when young’ in ‘when young, circuses appeal to all of us’\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"pfok\",\"hko2k\"],\"decisionId\":\"sense-compound-3b69701151af16ce0425f717\"}" ya
