su text "n:92459818-n | hydraulic motor | A hydraulic motor is a mechanical actuator that converts hydraulic pressure and flow into torque and angular displacement (rotation)." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92459818-n\",\"target\":\"hydraulic motor\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"hydraulic motor\"],\"definition\":\"A hydraulic motor is a mechanical actuator that converts hydraulic pressure and flow into torque and angular displacement (rotation).\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"xwik\",\"mrot\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-09b69af0f6787d8a68537425\"}" ya
su text "n:92459902-n | axial turbine | An axial flow turbine operates in the exactly reverse of an axial flow compressor," ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92459902-n\",\"target\":\"axial turbine\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"axial flow turbine\",\"axial turbine\"],\"definition\":\"An axial flow turbine operates in the exactly reverse of an axial flow compressor,\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"kci2c\",\"hti7n\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-2f7c174c0c7db29b254b56d5\"}" ya
su text "n:92459943-n | cobalt machine | A machine used in the treatment of cancer with the use of gamma rays from cobalt-60 radioisotopes." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92459943-n\",\"target\":\"cobalt machine\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"cobalt machine\"],\"definition\":\"A machine used in the treatment of cancer with the use of gamma rays from cobalt-60 radioisotopes.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"kwok\",\"myik\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-b28491b1ca464ac1c00112e7\"}" ya
su text "n:92460095-n | molecular pump | a vacuum pump that uses high speed jets of dense fluid or high speed rotating blades to knock gas molecules out of the chamber." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92460095-n\",\"target\":\"molecular pump\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"molecular pump\"],\"definition\":\"a vacuum pump that uses high speed jets of dense fluid or high speed rotating blades to knock gas molecules out of the chamber.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"myis\",\"pcop\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-5d24e86256cfd5d899c44d36\"}" ya
