su text "n:92460120-n | audio file | a computer file that contains digitized audio either in the Compact Disc (CDDA) format or in an MP3, AAC or other compressed format." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92460120-n\",\"target\":\"audio file\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"audio file\"],\"definition\":\"a computer file that contains digitized audio either in the Compact Disc (CDDA) format or in an MP3, AAC or other compressed format.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"dyim\",\"hfas\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-1f74a9b3592bbc9d75653da2\"}" ya
