su text "n:92460727-n | electronic music | a form of music consisting of sounds produced by oscillating electric currents either controlled from an instrument panel or keyboard or prerecorded on magnetic tape." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92460727-n\",\"target\":\"electronic music\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"electronic music\"],\"definition\":\"a form of music consisting of sounds produced by oscillating electric currents either controlled from an instrument panel or keyboard or prerecorded on magnetic tape.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"lyin\",\"hmik\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-d9342b0a970b254401e30722\"}" ya
su text "n:92460782-n | surf music | a genre of popular music associated with surf culture, particularly as found in Orange County and other areas of Southern California." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92460782-n\",\"target\":\"surf music\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"surf music\"],\"definition\":\"a genre of popular music associated with surf culture, particularly as found in Orange County and other areas of Southern California.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"hsof\",\"hmik\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-eea544915ab9ac6de178540a\"}" ya
