su text "n:92461160-n | cow brush | a stationary or rotating brush usually consisting of one horizontal and one vertical brush that cows use for scratching and grooming." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92461160-n\",\"target\":\"cow brush\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"cattle brush\",\"cow brush\"],\"definition\":\"a stationary or rotating brush usually consisting of one horizontal and one vertical brush that cows use for scratching and grooming.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"hgap\",\"broc\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-7cef4abe305de0ea6a33dbd9\"}" ya
su text "n:92461266-n | semaphore telegraph | a tower with pivoting shutters, also known as blades or paddles, used for conveying information by means of visual signals, read when the shutter is in a fixed position." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92461266-n\",\"target\":\"semaphore telegraph\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"chappe telegraph\",\"semaphore telegraph\"],\"definition\":\"a tower with pivoting shutters, also known as blades or paddles, used for conveying information by means of visual signals, read when the shutter is in a fixed position.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"hsa2f\",\"txaf\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-eb9eb820b453d499b7f0ec60\"}" ya
su text "n:92461352-n | sawdust stove | a stove that is cheap and easy to make, burns either free or low-cost fuel." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92461352-n\",\"target\":\"sawdust stove\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"sawdust stove\"],\"definition\":\"a stove that is cheap and easy to make, burns either free or low-cost fuel.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"tra2m\",\"hcop\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-d0c4c904d6b9b11563a738a9\"}" ya
su text "n:92461435-n | optical telegraph | any telegraph that uses visual signals to convey a message, including the use of smoke signals, beacons or reflected light, which have existed since ancient times." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92461435-n\",\"target\":\"optical telegraph\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"optical telegraph\"],\"definition\":\"any telegraph that uses visual signals to convey a message, including the use of smoke signals, beacons or reflected light, which have existed since ancient times.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"prok\",\"txaf\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-45293ff5123e659bf29d867b\"}" ya
su text "n:92461960-n | agglutinative language | a language in which words are made up of a linear sequence of distinct morphemes and each component of meaning is represented by its own morpheme." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92461960-n\",\"target\":\"agglutinative language\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"agglutinative language\"],\"definition\":\"a language in which words are made up of a linear sequence of distinct morphemes and each component of meaning is represented by its own morpheme.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"gxi2t\",\"pyac\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-1b24e0cb6507f42ae86382ed\"}" ya
