su text "n:92462411-n | fly press | a type of screw press in which the screw shaft is driven by a flywheel or a pair of fly weights at the ends of a bar." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92462411-n\",\"target\":\"fly press\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"fly press\"],\"definition\":\"a type of screw press in which the screw shaft is driven by a flywheel or a pair of fly weights at the ends of a bar.\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"fran\",\"pran\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-274dfb750ce73bda6a287699\"}" ya
