su text "n:92463288-n | long vowel | A vowel which is normally pronounced somewhat longer than other vowels (usually around 1½ to double length)." ob text "{\"senseId\":\"n:92463288-n\",\"target\":\"long vowel\",\"partOfSpeech\":\"n\",\"lemmas\":[\"long vowel\"],\"definition\":\"A vowel which is normally pronounced somewhat longer than other vowels (usually around 1½ to double length).\",\"pyashSequence\":[\"lyan\",\"hwak\"],\"decisionId\":\"derived-compound-5a8752ba35314c4471065b68\"}" ya
